      "notes": [
        "Take every number (layer means, ratios, percentages, fit) on each source's own grid with its own cell volume; regrid only for the Figure 2 maps, for display, and state the `regrid_horizontal` method used."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cmip6-grid-labels",
